@startuml
!include _style.iuml
[*] --> Validating : mtlj audit run
Validating --> [*] : bad setting (exit 2)
Validating --> Generating
Generating --> Confirming : over 1,000 scorings
Confirming --> [*] : declined (exit 1)
Confirming --> Scoring : yes / --yes
Generating --> Scoring : small run
Scoring --> Aborted : judge down, Ctrl+C,\nSIGTERM or SIGHUP
Scoring --> Analyzing : all tasks done
Analyzing --> Complete : 2+ scores on originals
Analyzing --> InsufficientData : no original with 2+ scores
Aborted --> [*] : status aborted (exit 1)
Aborted --> Scoring : mtlj audit resume
Complete --> [*] : status complete
InsufficientData --> [*] : status insufficient_data
@enduml
